# Code Review & Security Gate

## Security Verification
- Verify that every SQL table in `supabase/` has RLS enabled and enforces `auth.uid() = user_id`.
- Ensure no private keys or service-role secrets are exposed under `NEXT_PUBLIC_` prefixes.
- Sanitize incoming request payloads using Pydantic (FastAPI) or Zod (Next.js Server Actions).
- Confirm `extension/manifest.json` requests only minimum necessary permissions.

## Performance Verification
- Verify that no blocking I/O or synchronous LLM requests run in FastAPI HTTP request handlers.
- Ensure link card list components implement proper virtualization or memoization for large sets.
- Confirm raw scraped text is token-truncated before LLM processing.